  "title": "Linked Open Commerce",
  "description": {
    "en": "LOC (Linked Open Commerce) is a collaboration of OpenLink Software, Hepp Research GmbH and Linktegration that delivers a structured Linked Data space on the Web for finding products and services related offers, with precision.\r\n\r\nThis project seeks to provide a Linked Data substrate that delivers a foundation for new kinds of e-commerce applications and services.\r\n\r\n### Issues\r\n\r\nThe SPARQL endpoint also contains other, not e-Commerce related, RDF data collected from the Web."
